      "type": "self_analysis_kbat",
      "title": {
        "en": "Independent Scenario Analysis: role reversal",
        "zh": "独立情境分析：在价位确认突破后分析角色互换"
      },
      "prompt": {
        "en": "Analyse both a valid and an invalid interpretation of trading role reversal after confirmed level breaks using the assigned chart. Compare the evidence, explain the risk boundary, identify what would change your conclusion and state when no trade is preferable.",
